#: scenario3:scenario3_8E835108_88C9_4B53_89FB_A4E068E8C664
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3da760f0263b90dbd36ec85118b152374314861ccfecfe17e1d5e179f86a5bf4
#. default-sha256: e9fc89e154e7f22dacd5254d8a7bb6944eef1ae8dc25d1c40ef60ab45079de31
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8E835108_88C9_4B53_89FB_A4E068E8C664"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“That era was a rat race of innovation and development.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫Ce temps-là était marqué par une course effrénée vers l’innovation et le "
"progrès."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD8990AD_4FB5_43EB_8F10_572DDD636643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1272fceec25a8de3c5ba25a3bf306f5e00c2a7a896bf8c85b3d44a2308b4790
#. default-sha256: 5d2483194b443da36ce0b4356d9aaef4f68b7f3b0a7953b4fcae761673008b4f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DD8990AD_4FB5_43EB_8F10_572DDD636643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The smoke was so thick you could hardly see more than a few feet "
"ahead of you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫La fumée était si épaisse qu’on n’y voyait pas plus loin que le "
"bout de son nez."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD7ED951_99CE_419B_906E_75A964095B30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b2df21a6713dc17b288b500f5a0e03b9a9559a68b349d39964ea9dc67350a55
#. default-sha256: b06ddd478fcb6b65f5f1bc843672a5468182d68e7a592abd4f47d1f63d002a67
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD7ED951_99CE_419B_906E_75A964095B30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could compare it to a dense morning fog, but that might give the impression of beauty, and "
"there was little of that to be found in this haze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On pourrait la comparer à la brume d’un matin humide mais ça donnerait l’impression que "
"c’était beau, ce qui serait trompeur."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4A147A4_4735_4E91_B7A4_AE00AB086695
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 773fca0f810fdb2626ed0168a4d455b6ee85295a563de1e53d1b6ba30b61461b
#. default-sha256: ab8d22c612a31472b75604fb4c2b662a630de555e5b92551cce22e9684c46b7b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C4A147A4_4735_4E91_B7A4_AE00AB086695"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you see the silhouettes of several men in the smoky room? The one in the middle..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Est-ce que vous arrivez à distinguer les silhouettes de plusieurs hommes dans la salle "
"enfumée ? Celle du milieu..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_843D93F7_18AB_4BE1_ACC4_686F23490B2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 276206185abfe73b49570fffda32692b932aacc41f51b6518a92ca995ebd68b1
#. default-sha256: 51580a3f2ff463d5a27f03f960c6890c068a8f181ebe77a38d83da1944981c50
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_843D93F7_18AB_4BE1_ACC4_686F23490B2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the one looking in your direction, Master, was the present master of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...qui regarde dans votre direction, Maître, était le maître de la maison à cette époque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_33DC9683_41A1_4B38_8DD8_15B0F4734997
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f99e98725db0dfa77058a863826dae4575c974347eda3bc77c14894d91531e3f
#. default-sha256: 719df94cda00c1d3cdeaa6b6d1f299a2233b4014440835476eacfc1c95fffa5b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_33DC9683_41A1_4B38_8DD8_15B0F4734997"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫.................."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C61C8685_DE37_47A8_8269_793AFBD5A568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ed9427062ef7351a554036f91e620308cae9cf53d00325670415c2d2f49c672
#. default-sha256: 94564805f186cfc52660a7179271a3abb9f5c8b687abdb1c275ae93849f9700c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C61C8685_DE37_47A8_8269_793AFBD5A568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His name was Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫And though he dressed in such fine attire, I sincerely doubt he "
"understood how splendid the furnishings left in the mansion truly were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il s’appelait Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫Et même s’il était habillé très élégamment, je doute sincèrement "
"qu’il ait été à même de bien saisir la splendeur de l’ameublement du manoir qui avait traversé le "
"temps."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6083db9c125da3b3a8b0f421d460841fb51b32de168ec59a9c8d905301d216aa
#. default-sha256: f04b201a3774f40cca471ff83140b9b8040e1eaad5a36672c54e6c49cd17c54e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a faithful servant of this house, and I would not, for the life of me, dare speak ill "
"of my master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suis une fidèle servante de la maison et je n’oserais pas, au grand jamais, dire du mal "
"de mon maître."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEB9FDC0_046A_42EE_8B43_5C0C9C5589A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b6ae3d8215e3e2c5a7a73afd7e2a29023904099866c137156a212afbe122e47
#. default-sha256: 9bf073642ada190af64bdc5d19945ee764d07f35f77668781e85f7c8b2de0573
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEB9FDC0_046A_42EE_8B43_5C0C9C5589A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, this is a time long past. ⟪k:1⟫I imagine God would be so kind as to turn a blind "
"eye to a little bit of honesty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais là, il y a prescription. ⟪k:1⟫Je m’avance peut-être en pensant que Dieu me pardonnera "
"ce petit écart de sincérité."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81DEF471_22C8_4193_B901_A06BB672C4BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab1550e28421ee2e0666d97490eaf3772564b2f345b5149786883e7637199c14
#. default-sha256: 79fc721a1bbb28f26fd5e268acd92c2baef504aff494c0a0506399aaaef59259
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81DEF471_22C8_4193_B901_A06BB672C4BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was not terribly fond of my master back then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je n’appréciais pas particulièrement mon maître à l’époque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20B2DA55_451B_4359_8C0B_D2005B3D1DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 702804bb032c79f566792a482b014619e89a6ef2b4057cb1f5a2a2b43aff8f1f
#. default-sha256: 32b84c069318eb8b6ac5ba9702ca2fd45b569a8fd2c907d141b35270b0420bb3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20B2DA55_451B_4359_8C0B_D2005B3D1DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had wavy hair the color of over-dried tea leaves, a piercing gaze, an arrogant smile, and "
"he wore a hat that made him look rather haughty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il avait des cheveux ondulés de la couleur des feuilles de thé séchées, un regard perçant, "
"un sourire arrogant, et il portait un chapeau qui lui donnait un air assez hautain."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49BCB5BF_992C_4E26_9B8C_22DFED8E78E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 285e5d664f44a3c18cd19c853f31b7201874863a8f6dfe38f517311c4561cff8
#. default-sha256: 34bef1de77c3d35f4944e502ac9f48edc8313eebbb441ca4aa3f5b8dc211d4f4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49BCB5BF_992C_4E26_9B8C_22DFED8E78E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He put his trust only in money, renown, and rank. ⟪k:1⟫He loved only the iron and steel that "
"had revolutionized so many industries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il ne croyait qu’en trois choses : l’argent, la réputation et le rang social. ⟪k:1⟫Il "
"n’avait d’amour que pour le fer et l’acier qui avaient révolutionné tant de domaines."

#: scenario3:scenario3_417C8F41_851A_4AAE_A018_3ACE20BBE061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e8938fea459c2dee9fa5d6f7fea963b0af27b750ec9cbb5bd1769dde89dbf03
#. default-sha256: 006447c08125ad2e59b22a304a93bcfa90031b95447aa92ee378df2d870f6e48
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_417C8F41_851A_4AAE_A018_3ACE20BBE061"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had not the slightest bit of love or care for other people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’amour ou l’amitié lui étaient totalement inconnus."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECA0CD3B_8E6F_4843_9D9A_2760C8911005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 590e46b0aed15959e33f73e65f282ea94d22c8793dbe2a11c424afd148fbab04
#. default-sha256: 6a3abd2522460b0488b4598fa2438af6ad8744632ed2b6d9141cbd8e7dac707a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECA0CD3B_8E6F_4843_9D9A_2760C8911005"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the very least, that is what I believed at the time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫En tout cas, c’est ce que je croyais à l’époque."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8D069546_106A_450D_821B_0182902A2190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bb0b213fef0ca2c7b304e1e435ccc0a6cc489ae201be95608e2c5eced713bec
#. default-sha256: 623b6a34a2b7505164150f93af74966a9e8221554268e8d8f4ad8adcafbdb0e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8D069546_106A_450D_821B_0182902A2190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Take a look around the room, Master. ⟪k:1⟫Jacopo had remodeled it into a recreation area."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Regardez attentivement cette pièce, Maître. ⟪k:1⟫Jacopo l’avait transformée en salle de jeux."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B09B01C_64CD_4BA4_B1EA_B31A4481408E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88f9baf24d5d175198f9bc0330acae30951d9cef21a40ab80229397a3784330c
#. default-sha256: 668c101186f2f3d6c9b5ced4640fefbd754ae9f06e7add1b4589cccabfd90198
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B09B01C_64CD_4BA4_B1EA_B31A4481408E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A billiards table sat in the center of the room, and the downward-facing lights hanging from "
"the ceiling were special-made."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Un billard trônait au milieu et l’éclairage direct qui pendait du plafond avait été fait sur "
"mesure."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7051DB35_42B3_4571_830C_41BA1F25F41E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48075f44f13e3266b544b5c0fd646fb73af9d3526a1da8e8980dfef37d733b5d
#. default-sha256: f029477945dc983109ea0740b7f5f081f3a80a975dabc3c810a6623fbb633bc0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7051DB35_42B3_4571_830C_41BA1F25F41E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The lights shone upon the dark green stand like a stage. Cigars and bourbon lined glass "
"cases installed in place of bookshelves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La lumière brillait sur la table vert foncé comme sur une scène. La bibliothèque vitrée "
"contenait, non pas des livres, mais des cigares et des bouteilles de whisky."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A8CDD86_601E_4688_8A6B_6657465ACFCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beb2c148fa102db316a4db8e3c54005a52c11203da19a5ae54b5fffaa5de2c0b
#. default-sha256: 50c572c19620986b766c54c39e90dffe7a96126b140dea1e8534730f870cfa6f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A8CDD86_601E_4688_8A6B_6657465ACFCC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cases were always fully stocked, their contents available to partake of readily. ⟪k:1⟫At "
"that particular moment, as he had many times before, Jacopo had invited several friends and "
"acquaintances, and they were entertaining themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les étagères étaient toujours bien remplies, afin de pouvoir profiter de leur contenu à tout "
"moment. ⟪k:1⟫Au moment qui nous intéresse, comme bien d’autres fois auparavant, Jacopo avait "
"invité plusieurs amis et connaissances et ils se divertissaient."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37552AB0_63A9_4810_A76F_97FE22DA86AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: debd0213db9a79946db5b45f2ec29bfe5ee7f8fc2a0f727b2df98fa849725252
#. default-sha256: ce2bce4ef9e60f6026d9937c5faf82e0a907cc231e4c6c07be8813a07d1b2222
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37552AB0_63A9_4810_A76F_97FE22DA86AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His wealthy, high-ranking acquaintances had a variety of hair colors: from polished brass to "
"the brown of a baby robin to the color of sunburnt wheat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Parmi ses connaissances riches et haut placées, ils avaient tous des couleurs de cheveux "
"différentes, du cuivre poli au brun merle ; certains avaient même la couleur du blé séché au "
"soleil."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3CD8BF7_8D14_46AE_B341_AE03FAC831A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b3ffa7dc57c5f4fdd726856d73b6405d938e9c507df275216c8a9d81ca47620
#. default-sha256: a6b011ddba161d1357db28f598e40bd337392ae653c3847c15fdbd75a3811500
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3CD8BF7_8D14_46AE_B341_AE03FAC831A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was also much greater variation in skin tone compared to the visitors and residents of "
"previous eras."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il y avait une plus grande variation encore dans leur couleur de peau, comparée aux "
"visiteurs et habitants des époques précédentes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A736809_12E0_4230_B5B3_7FE1CFF7E687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fd7bf1d1f84d4ba4d4c20486cd934527ebe402edc42ad3c5cd5cf65660983f9
#. default-sha256: d8c8265c2f4df5040194c63be60b2a610a0ed9e8fcdf84ec93c884e193285b24
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A736809_12E0_4230_B5B3_7FE1CFF7E687"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that was hardly any surprise, for the mansion sat upon land inhabited largely by "
"immigrants—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the New World."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais ce n’était pas une surprise, car le manoir était située sur une terre habitée surtout "
"par des immigrés—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ le Nouveau Monde."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B3130DE2_7D1A_45DF_9A81_B7476D740D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0558e572c923249e4d4ea19690161cdc1a304b22ef2568d6155275365c8a4e38
#. default-sha256: 94b0afba401e23b91519ce03e492649c686d1e4cc54a949b4ffd862b69837af1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B3130DE2_7D1A_45DF_9A81_B7476D740D7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:4⟫What are you lookin’ at?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Qu’est-ce qui s’passe ?⟪k:4⟫Qu’est-c’tu regardes ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABFD0457_E718_47AD_AB2B_EBF09734F651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92ab5d1c77e83aa1ce2df2a9e6be27c4016c5f3868344aef08ea5b1a481bcee0
#. default-sha256: 2e6f21377c528594cd325959442af5a923171c7c3347bfd38c3cf85b7dcb376c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABFD0457_E718_47AD_AB2B_EBF09734F651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nothing.⟪k:2⟫I just thought I heard someone say my name."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Rien.⟪k:2⟫J’ai juste cru entendre mon nom."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B2C6DB2_244C_4B8F_8C5F_BA81CCCB11EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ed19f14bff61837f2449e5746f418e379fdbb565034ba6603a7228114ce837e
#. default-sha256: 0a2ac4eea9ca486ba87557790fe9056c26f2804b634804488c884f444708801c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B2C6DB2_244C_4B8F_8C5F_BA81CCCB11EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ain’t no one there, ’less you’re seein’ a ghost."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Y a personne d’autre ici, à moins qu’tu voyes des fantômes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_58407D64_52AF_4FD1_8ABC_748EAA280E5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94b6595339a931b88fdfeea6fa0b76f7e07c52fd9a0f10dbdab23e09b791a07e
#. default-sha256: 72000a46b09e15e2caa0be932ed6f05ebbab4347bb3a85bd3e2562e4db172ca3
