msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9284FAB1_ED7F_4207_9568_67323E6E71E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(You’re a bunch of damned imbeciles if you can’t see that the entire country’s put their "
"weight behind this endeavor. ⟪k:1⟫This is why you have so much trouble making even a few "
"thousand.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Vous êtes une sacrée bande d’abrutis si vous n’arrivez pas à voir que tout le pays s’est "
"mis à soutenir cette entreprise. ⟪k:1⟫C’est pour ça que vous avez autant de mal à gagner ne "
"serait-ce que quelques milliers.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_30529893_CC7B_4811_9CA5_806F5AE6C270
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c17f5821882176241b03aa6daf2e6184fc27bbad31c491fd12586b5b997ac4b
#. default-sha256: 76ed31d76f95ec5197c5c195ebef227fc18bcb4c189c938d8356044458fe2aac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_30529893_CC7B_4811_9CA5_806F5AE6C270"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫At the time, a great railway was being built across the breadth of "
"the continent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫À⟪k:7⟫ l’époque, une grande voie ferrée traversant tout le "
"continent était en construction."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4422813fff54c5a4a67c6af891cfb6796960a58c8689ff21fdb59ee098384f8
#. default-sha256: 1309169341c0d75464f4dc2f50546bee3203fa10b2ff18454e8aa3e7f81f5c80
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Construction was spearheaded by two large rail companies, in competition for both prestige "
"and a bigger share of this massive national enterprise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deux grosses entreprises de chemin de fer dirigeaient le chantier ; elles étaient en "
"compétition l’une contre l’autre, luttant pour le prestige et pour une plus grosse part de cet "
"immense projet national."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81b2bf9cd90a0f6ed28aaad826442d10b24f0f934c6500586ba0633dab0c8b17
#. default-sha256: ddfef90e9c34469bd09272f396216c059e2ddb8c6f236296a5b4e85a561e0a7c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Union Pacific Railroad Company started building from the east, and the Central Pacific "
"Railroad Company from the west."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Société de Chemins de Fer du Pacifique Uni avait commencé à l’est et la Société de "
"Chemins de Fer du Pacifique Centre à l’ouest."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b0fd81cf8214047067872b7281a76f3ba21b51801d60691ba68aa38e69d9543
#. default-sha256: f0095c4ec4f9d9aa0d98bbbe903c569d1c1cd9bed10840dc03a97ebf3644d575
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But government bonds alone were not enough to finance the massive undertaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais les aides du gouvernement ne suffisaient pas à financer un chantier aussi énorme."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b55dc719e6291349e31be091c7401ae7220cd6a825722a233c7cdff74470897c
#. default-sha256: 0284df224447b86c57633ecec43a414fbbd7cd1e5c462a052f6140d76015b4d9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By the way, there’ve been some less-than-pleasant reports about workers dyin’ on the job for "
"the company you chose—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Central Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au fait, j’ai appris qu’y a eu des rapports pas très agréables sur des ouvriers morts au "
"boulot dans la société que tu as choisie—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ le Pacifique Centre."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf78961e8822dfc6c3fd2e20cef61ca010780d974270f10ce2403153c148a096
#. default-sha256: cecc2b0b1311af4f6b0702ef4bfeac20478db3e8f9ffa278ca53c826df14507d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, ya mean how they’re usin’ explosives to blast through the mountains? ⟪k:1⟫Makin’ quite "
"a bang, they are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, tu parles des explosifs qu’ils utilisent pour faire sauter les montagnes ? ⟪k:1⟫Ça a "
"fait du raffut, pour sûr."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b862cce2a2e0411b95c7ef650f5274b098519a86c0bad365dea82cb81f1d37be
#. default-sha256: ba8f6a9575ea7cfb3e594e08c422d4a2602146c5a0d92df039204e62044b7fa2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if this gets to be much bigger of a fix,⟪k:1⟫they’re not gonna be able to continue "
"construction.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You shoulda at least put your money in the more sure bet of the two—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫the Union Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais s’ils arrivent pas à gérer ça,⟪k:1⟫ils vont pas pouvoir continuer la construction.⟪k:2⟫"
"⟪k:3⟫Tu ferais mieux de placer ton argent dans la plus sûre des deux—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ le Pacifique Uni."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c0c3443a37e51a0af37531ec98819ee4bcae0c88132ba9b14979000157ba294
#. default-sha256: 71e7eb47a667e232f08957776255b10b085fa0263500cda961e5a476b12218f4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’ll cost ya to hire replacement workers, and if they keep kickin’ the bucket, you’re gonna "
"have trouble findin’ more—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ça va te coûter, de remplacer les ouvriers, et s’ils continuent à crever, tu vas avoir du "
"mal à en trouver d’autres—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c32faa5e01f90b295aa238d1a17e6ea0f3a9d598f860adf3ae5487702b20a2b
#. default-sha256: b13c15991ee3a03a2d3251b71e6bad438655822f2c7746f79a7e5bedfc05a247
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My goodness.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And here I thought you all had spines."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oh, mon Dieu.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Et moi qui pensais que vous en aviez dans le "
"ciboulot."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fcff155856ec61b2c28418cdea07cc1e6aec6b9db11193269128b617158a4dd2
#. default-sha256: 029cebe98ce7fe6133b09a962c686cd3d3dcfe2caa318f3d97729346cab88f40
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You think we’re gonna run out of workers just because a few ate it? ⟪k:3⟫Hah. "
"There’re so many we don’t even know what to do with them all. ⟪k:4⟫There’s not a chance that well "
"will dry up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Vous pensez vraiment qu’on va manquer d’ouvriers sous prétexte que quelques-uns "
"ont cassé leur pipe ? ⟪k:3⟫Hah. Il y en a tellement qu’on ne sait même pas quoi en faire. ⟪k:4⟫Il "
"n’y a aucune chance que nous nous retrouvions à court."

#: scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ddd2b9057cb40ae34f5a1fa8efb446854702fc242bd0cdaf069a57775b357a48
#. default-sha256: 4c712dc8f8deddcb524e9cf633231f234319991b4533ba881704df8b0c695617
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And if, by some chance, it ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫, all we have to do is scoop up a shipful of "
"blacks or yellows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Et quand bien même ce serait le cas, nous n’aurions qu’à ramasser une cargaison de "
"Noirs ou de Jaunes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80fbed64b50b4ea0a16e308b1bd59b225b82fa37b51ee3f3f3bcedcc874005f4
#. default-sha256: a5ccf8b8e2d470e23fced59f07f7c0a206e0d4ff52390cedc832f667ca0cd983
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You won’t get anywhere if you spend your time worrying about a few measly laborers. ⟪k:1⟫"
"This is an endeavor backed by the entire nation.⟪k:2⟫Their deaths are honorable, in service of "
"their country."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si vous passez votre temps à vous inquiéter d’une poignée de travailleurs minables, vous "
"n’irez pas loin. ⟪k:1⟫La nation entière soutient cette entreprise. Leurs morts sont honorables, "
"au service de leur pays."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73809939ea46325bbcb4a049a9bab7dff9a1b01784a100401061c0888c00b953
#. default-sha256: 58a5a858bf62b78685979adcfe38e58a63cc342eb29924368727bd1f82c335ca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The biggest loss is not of people’s lives, but of ⟪k:2⟫time⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The longer a "
"project takes, the more money it costs,⟪k:6⟫and the less profit we make."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La plus grande perte, ce n’est pas la vie des gens, mais le ⟪k:2⟫temps⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Plus un projet prend du temps, plus il coûte cher,⟪k:6⟫et moins il y a de profit pour nous."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd48a89ec2649ab192d9ed4f437d47acbfb881e690816690314282fe992a7dfb
#. default-sha256: 1d31b2fb4a8618884e89aa6ed5aebcb92af23aeec0ff4c16229630ed7bd44045
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What we seek is rapid progress,⟪k:2⟫even if the methods to obtain it are messy—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫or deadly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce que l’on veut, c’est que ça avance rapidement,⟪k:2⟫même si les méthodes pour arriver "
"à nos fins sont désordonnées—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ ou mortelles."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EDA1E3C7_E138_4889_B6F9_43E3D0EA7306
