#: scenario3:scenario3_D4E4D65E_EA67_4FC6_9618_5AF463B6B622
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 178131bbb511dfa9eca8f518f54192e1dc3f2a3f4c2c3fa35560ba8b938828de
#. default-sha256: 51c358aa38af80773f751d2a046e913215884142264290adbdc92cab000bcb40
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D4E4D65E_EA67_4FC6_9618_5AF463B6B622"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The other men in the room chuckled uncomfortably at Jacopo’s distasteful choice of words."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ses paroles de mauvais goût provoquèrent des rires gênés chez ses hôtes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5C9354BC_4C69_44D9_9188_13AD9CA3D36B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e9a9278d7de4b9ca17aa737292b20902d013a26003d869320ae5d9a897e4eb3
#. default-sha256: 5ff1bb8cff7a3a4edc65263fcad35ed82e133b2647db1b24b1b560723f6df3b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5C9354BC_4C69_44D9_9188_13AD9CA3D36B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you agree with his way of thinking, Master? ⟪k:1⟫Perhaps he ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫ have a point, "
"in that great sacrifice is necessary to accomplish great things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ê⟪k:2⟫tes-vous d’accord avec cette manière de penser, Maître ? ⟪k:3⟫Peut-être a-t-il "
"⟪k:4⟫raison⟪k:5⟫, dans le sens où de grandes choses nécessitent de grands sacrifices."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B248FC95_2414_4629_BEDC_C071979861F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8877918fc306abbfc37b675546173873792244cdaf2e2803e65bf85af8cba43
#. default-sha256: 30297ae09a2a2106892cab238e5290edcb026fe2c21a5b2514ff832ca0639df0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B248FC95_2414_4629_BEDC_C071979861F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it ⟪k:1⟫is⟪k:2⟫ true that tragedy often lies in the shadows of the splendor of times "
"long past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et c’est ⟪k:1⟫vrai⟪k:2⟫ que la tragédie se terre souvent dans les zones d’ombre de la "
"splendeur des temps passés."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8EC68CFC_90A0_416A_A552_7BFA828EB5DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df05014f1faaf91f1cba364e6ead8c0b87736fd4788ca8da8ebf16b6b36ac805
#. default-sha256: 2c9a651062b2f2c74edf193f9cb281d7c64abbf4f763320d87aad3bf2d6624a6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8EC68CFC_90A0_416A_A552_7BFA828EB5DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, the way people see the world changes with the times,⟪k:1⟫so I hesitate to "
"criticize him too severely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De plus, la façon dont les gens voient le monde change avec le temps,⟪k:1⟫alors j’hésite à "
"le critiquer trop sévèrement."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23D5714C_C893_476E_929E_01CEC85B734C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72546b0c6bb02e966d7565a213d5b6843ae03fc27bb4fe8249e6d11401da3d51
#. default-sha256: d6d22563de0dd17128401bf38a1d9d515c31ccc8b67f0d4ac20d63c69eaa1b28
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23D5714C_C893_476E_929E_01CEC85B734C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as I am sure you have already picked up on, he was an investor who had put money into a "
"railroad company."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Bon, je suppose qu’à ce stade vous avez compris qu’il avait investi dans une société de "
"chemins de fer."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A882DDAB_59EA_4E13_A84D_DF62EE1A6E57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e40efc2adca47dcdaac1905060fac0da2a904ec076293bc579b541862b23d8e9
#. default-sha256: e97455b268f66f6c2b110ed1865c4b3db6cba9e2864f6503ed3bf360a63516f1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A882DDAB_59EA_4E13_A84D_DF62EE1A6E57"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He also possessed several crude oil refineries, riding on the world’s second wave of "
"industrial development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il possédait aussi plusieurs raffineries de pétrole brut, surfant ainsi sur la seconde vague "
"mondiale du développement industriel."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1DA11088_1AC0_41B3_8B01_A37C9909C970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad6f65c9b0aa98830425903ec7ead48cad87e39773be99f4c8905cb663b651a2
#. default-sha256: e9b2dde42b19fde99c7754937ef29c8f20463ee84bde904317a1b365d5606c1c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1DA11088_1AC0_41B3_8B01_A37C9909C970"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mansion too bustled with life, in a way it never had before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le manoir aussi était animé comme il ne l’avait jamais été."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB2E2D3C_C4A0_4E41_A331_311470DD8B84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8353f5ece30cee6943d3cc15f10575e4a85bedf1abfc9125a57d00e5f9ed26b5
#. default-sha256: 9fe9eefb38e7d454739eb78ac51cf74bd4a9e6ddc6132898f5bf785468da88cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB2E2D3C_C4A0_4E41_A331_311470DD8B84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dozens of maids—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫including me—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫gardeners, chefs, sculptors, artists..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il y avait des dizaines de serviteurs —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ moi incluse —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ des jardiniers, "
"des chefs, des sculpteurs, des artistes..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79610573_7280_4181_B2CF_FE7FEB89901B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e916cfb0ec0a39c222c262ea1563c83a89755ce321ac926ff66c08390d2d3c7e
#. default-sha256: 5deba1dfec56b3000e0f964d1bfdcc3e2ba31cacb5507756587c7078952cef52
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79610573_7280_4181_B2CF_FE7FEB89901B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At times, we even had writers coming in and out of the house.⟪k:1⟫There was rarely a moment "
"of silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De temps à autre, on avait même des écrivains qui allaient et venaient dans la maison. Il "
"n’y avait pas un moment de calme."

#: scenario3:scenario3_426F30AE_2B88_49C2_9A79_DE11CB535287
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98e05e1f807b5ad3035f3fad8bc96dbbe8842f49e588d347accf87dae817fc5d
#. default-sha256: 8de4527e6b06745958ae3f5d7c61a78c42cc1b90972f00a218c85d58a9c84024
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_426F30AE_2B88_49C2_9A79_DE11CB535287"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, I was not terribly fond of the hustle and bustle, personally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pourtant, je n’étais pas particulièrement contente de toute cette agitation, en ce qui me "
"concerne."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61A1AB56_2265_4D97_9B8C_BDFB15FB8DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01484a577398586f854950cf2712213ec36111ac98ff161a014acf21435d2198
#. default-sha256: 7c789f5941db8b2382c1a4fffeac0a78cff59523f86dee3ce01854a7cd32ab23
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61A1AB56_2265_4D97_9B8C_BDFB15FB8DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But please do not get me wrong.⟪k:1⟫I am hardly opposed to the mansion being cheerful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais comprenez-moi bien.⟪k:1⟫Je n’étais pas opposée à ce que le manoir soit un endroit plein "
"de vie."

#: scenario3:scenario3_04829561_3D31_4451_84E0_78F5BD15913A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a6a7b473fd17413acde2aded72d42b3f9e27ad31fd9b95b0f374a7638475c88
#. default-sha256: 5b5ae434a15329720aa539cdbf0548d2d1a791396468588a05992de921aeb022
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_04829561_3D31_4451_84E0_78F5BD15913A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was just... ⟪k:1⟫how should I put it?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The splendor of the time seemed... ⟪k:4⟫"
"superficial, heartless."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est juste que... ⟪k:1⟫comment dirais-je ?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La magnificence de l’époque semblait "
"quelque peu... ⟪k:4⟫superficielle, froide."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFFE1E3A_AB91_4009_BD53_6AAFB549C704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cff938be39e02fb8a2be8699bc1bd9d6d63d457d76eb7e93a15b5c81c0632e3
#. default-sha256: c0ad0adddcdcb7b4605196f209b55e8f4e3061daba9347a4fab15db5e55379a9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFFE1E3A_AB91_4009_BD53_6AAFB549C704"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though everyone was being rushed along by some unknown, invisible force."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est comme si tout le monde était bousculé, pressé par une force invisible et inconnue."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37FC4A4B_2155_4828_BE9A_8E877C39DBCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcbcb2dfc40e7ba89e4a9b3b8f75c1e956fc7fb1b2407d8d0a78aa6c0baf000c
#. default-sha256: e7c5b521714d940336d1265cd5848fd0b1dbd951c858c5308136023b1f865bad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37FC4A4B_2155_4828_BE9A_8E877C39DBCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Part of it was, I expect, caused by the growing divide between those standing at the top and "
"sitting at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela s’explique en partie, je pense, par l’écart qui ne cessait de se creuser entre la "
"classe dirigeante et la classe populaire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_082104C6_ED70_4C6F_9130_F18A25A16D44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbf5ead582d3e2de395bb650c4b50a8ff2ea2fd77b3e6f9c4b84eb7587351c36
#. default-sha256: 00f2d1191fb60594dad565ecd2e780fa63f79f4e023719956d083b8542c80c27
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_082104C6_ED70_4C6F_9130_F18A25A16D44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps... ⟪k:1⟫the mansion was simply taking after its master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ou bien peut-être... ⟪k:1⟫que le manoir ressemblait simplement à son maître."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6E1AEF15_A89A_462C_9BC4_BCFD88DF88B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9aa0de9656f4b9ea8ce30fdbc0640fcfa95ebbb16505ec43b53e7578b1157d2
#. default-sha256: 6802dd854e694f44f3864ca08de34b3e1fbda0d97d2937e005cd6effb454a4f1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6E1AEF15_A89A_462C_9BC4_BCFD88DF88B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(There’s no time to waste.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Everything is resting upon the success of this "
"project.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(Il n’y a pas de temps à perdre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tout repose sur le succès de ce projet.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D5002CC8_8E4D_4B86_BE01_906CCB21B6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 100a3c97f5f1ba4532f0559a74e17e2294a8d459aa2807bc90994ad99b8aa4ba
#. default-sha256: b729765afa9eae392448ab9b54a0e1cf98a63608fdeb1ce9c93433c51a5894de
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5002CC8_8E4D_4B86_BE01_906CCB21B6A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Whatever it takes, I will ensure it happens.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I need more money—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and more "
"power.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Je ferai tout ce qui est en mon pouvoir.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫J’ai besoin de plus d’argent—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ "
"et de pouvoir.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C57388D1_6602_450D_AEE0_891B57137426
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b59762383dd9f8e137261385609abd7926822b78a915668735d09614be7f47a
#. default-sha256: 832c83f1237a40e13cabba86ee8a7e2e7eedbf8bb3f2086573fd0f1efec4d817
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C57388D1_6602_450D_AEE0_891B57137426"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Suddenly, a restrained knock on the door stopped his train of thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tout à coup, un léger toc à la porte arrêta le cours de ses pensées."

#: scenario3:scenario3_40EBA367_8E41_4003_BE7B_13581118E09F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7387b22e6c9853c1f2774b78140d4d9b0f166e8c331ab02e985fc88e9512558
#. default-sha256: b34a1979271ef070e03e48b1d5d2530a0a16995acb2c1938569d8ec7115febd3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_40EBA367_8E41_4003_BE7B_13581118E09F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫From beyond the door came a woman’s voice,⟪k:1⟫gentle as a soft spring breeze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De derrière la porte, une voix de femme s’éleva,⟪k:1⟫aussi douce qu’une tendre brise d’été."

#: scenario3:scenario3_68518924_CABD_4491_A14E_CF9D67C8F26B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e933714edec2fc27dcd5abfab8a0a0ae4585beb5623c769aaaf6ab9a74370111
#. default-sha256: dbd011a7feaa77b082e98290cd59979f813d0bfd2f259217cf0224ecff682e49
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_68518924_CABD_4491_A14E_CF9D67C8F26B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pardon me... ⟪k:3⟫I have made some tea.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫May I offer anyone a cup?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excusez-moi... ⟪k:3⟫j’ai fait du thé.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Puis-je vous en offrir une tasse ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_52C897BC_60EC_45E1_890C_CFB9B6DE0D3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2075af9e34649a9027e08821110499ce2d327e47488067c4805db8c6bfc69623
#. default-sha256: 388b8d9e1ccc35ea87bb469a7b541ef7a04b3cd2282c2325e074db9f91727cca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52C897BC_60EC_45E1_890C_CFB9B6DE0D3B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When the door opened, in it stood a beautiful woman with pure white hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quand la porte s’ouvrit, une belle femme aux cheveux d’un blanc pur "
"apparut."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD1EE541_5034_41B8_9BAA_896DCCAA171D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b4ee5e2251e94d07569f95db97fa76a8a8f8d78ffb215757fa8a5bd2ba4c621
#. default-sha256: 6a7abf2abb6cb1a07a575a189fbbcc60958dd881e22a5c8aa723cc504be92847
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD1EE541_5034_41B8_9BAA_896DCCAA171D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was indeed her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you surprised?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or did you anticipate her appearance?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’était bien elle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ê⟪k:4⟫tes-vous surpris ?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ou bien aviez-vous prévu "
"qu’elle apparaîtrait ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3248BDB4_7924_4928_A149_A458C4694B46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea6109d7b7eaa65da79edae747e72b2904e47dd2aa4abdc4b3413b33b3aac03f
#. default-sha256: d57d3cfafd07eac1b86cf66b25ee66212f4bc5154b3d3fbff7c87ce83955a928
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3248BDB4_7924_4928_A149_A458C4694B46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she was not the same age and dressed differently, the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"whom you saw fall into the hands of misfortune in the era of roses and the era of the beast—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫was also present in this era of innovation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Même si elle n’avait pas le même âge et était habillée différemment, la Fille aux Cheveux "
"Blancs —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ que vous avez vue en proie au malheur à l’époque des roses et à l’époque de la "
"bête —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ était aussi présente dans cet âge d’innovation."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DF14322C_3A97_4B2A_BDC7_55BAA3FAB9CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d88fa2b88a45914d0afa2a0f273da1225252bba3e15b4cbe1c0d0f00d709c8dc
#. default-sha256: b1d035f91cd6bc9554a42dfcf24c7aabc19ec4379a5f0e62c5c50da55e1335e9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DF14322C_3A97_4B2A_BDC7_55BAA3FAB9CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, she was Jacopo’s wife."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle était par ailleurs l’épouse de Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_11EEB77C_73D6_4AA9_94BA_60C408C156B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 954b75836be10163a05b74ac1ce5302225493c54cbdea2d1c695279a8cbd53be
