msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_11EEB77C_73D6_4AA9_94BA_60C408C156B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫...⟪k:9⟫Tea?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I don’t recall asking "
"for that.⟪k:13⟫When were you asked to make it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫...⟪k:9⟫Du thé ?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Je n’ai pas "
"souvenir d’en avoir demandé.⟪k:13⟫Quand vous ai-je demandé d’en faire ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C2229566_5C3D_4FF9_BB47_A5A49C210700
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aa718d399cf8fb8fd1b30cb591b24753a9bd5d45f645670328c70dbcaec7d9b3
#. default-sha256: 7214c320e97731f64910964f8e0b11ef16cce3891630442f23555dd4c9fb206a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C2229566_5C3D_4FF9_BB47_A5A49C210700"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t... ⟪k:2⟫but I had these leaves with the most wonderful aroma, and I thought "
"you might enjoy—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous n’avez rien demandé... ⟪k:2⟫mais j’avais ces feuilles qui dégagent un arôme "
"irrésistible, et je me suis dit que vous aimeriez—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_75735651_F2FA_4028_A73C_B6F968F5E6AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a46eaa4b17b27697440fb9c90fcc9402feb719384ae08f580dfeb2ff59a71367
#. default-sha256: 8b084228b66ae1062394f5c51aaf90dd234ea7670c16ccc792f7dbd63e10cd06
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_75735651_F2FA_4028_A73C_B6F968F5E6AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Shut your trap and know your place!⟪k:2⟫What do you think we have all these maids for?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Fermez-la et comportez-vous comme il se doit !⟪k:2⟫Pourquoi pensez-vous qu’on ait tous "
"ces serviteurs ?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_348C41F0_1B2F_40FC_A864_7A491B0FE7D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
