msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫H-⟪k:3⟫Hey now.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No need to treat your lady like that.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫She was "
"just tryin’ to be courteous..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫H-⟪k:3⟫Hé, c’est bon.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Pas besoin de traiter ta p’tite dame comme ça.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Elle voulait juste être polie..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_920BF359_584F_4A21_B82E_9B3FC3142426
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54fba4fa544c016a03a0d7f9ae74c3733bee6c2160fc7430b01d0c17949ad29f
#. default-sha256: dcc8b8fd00efe5cda74f17d6ec3993d99e4428b684aaf39b7faad8b53dbdd613
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_920BF359_584F_4A21_B82E_9B3FC3142426"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫These are ⟪k:2⟫my⟪k:3⟫ personal affairs.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Please keep your comments to yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ce sont ⟪k:2⟫mes⟪k:3⟫ affaires.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Je vous prierai de vous abstenir de tout "
"commentaire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79045E26_4053_46A1_9236_48E03EBB901C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5af02e08d7385766fd5806a3d190564ad5021f971261407e9629225bf54d17c9
#. default-sha256: 5fa93b0791c4e5b34c6c48a1e5469e4cc050a68e9be67976772e8a2c3c7f9b4a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79045E26_4053_46A1_9236_48E03EBB901C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His friends were unsure how to react, but ultimately, nobody stepped up to stop Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They merely shrugged, tossing glances at one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ses amis ne savaient pas exactement comment réagir mais au final, personne ne s’opposa à "
"Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫Ils se contentèrent de hausser les épaules et de se regarder les uns les autres."

#: scenario3:scenario3_50AD6C6C_54B8_468F_8796_E30032D916A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f649aefd67bacf8fd65c912c79a390dd0cbf1ed86e8662c28671c6978b68ed90
#. default-sha256: 948be6b6cef3c82efd0173aab5dc1538be3ff172771a20e2e8d166c4aba3393b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50AD6C6C_54B8_468F_8796_E30032D916A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo stomped over to the White-Haired Girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He then grabbed her by the arm "
"and dragged her from the den."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo se dirigea en tapant du pied vers la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Puis il "
"la prit par le bras et la traîna hors du repaire."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D3A6526_DE5E_46C2_82FE_D26E2838A109
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17b33a798814b478ba36e509e45c15a15b122eb6f9d83bd68b0870c70d576d22
